  "substitutions_note": "None. Every face named for these four families is in the Google Fonts repository, and every weight asked for exists there, so no face and no weight was replaced.",
  "decisions": [
    {
      "about": "four families",
      "note": "The folder was cut from eight families to four. Spectral, Caslon, Vollkorn and Hyperlegible were dropped, and the faces only they used were deleted along with their licences."
    },
    {
      "about": "Atkinson Hyperlegible italic",
      "note": "The 400 italic file was deleted with the Hyperlegible family, which was the only one that set text in it. Bitter uses Atkinson only as a label face, at 400 and 700, so those two files stay."
    },
    {
      "about": "variable sources",
      "note": "Where the repository ships only a variable font, the file was instanced to the exact weight asked for with fontTools instancer before subsetting. Non default axes were pinned to their default values."
    }
  ],
