  "marks_note": "The arrow and check marks the site draws are not in most of these faces. Nothing was added to the fonts. Where a face lacks a mark the browser takes that one character from the next font in the stack, which is the matching system stack, so the mark still appears but in the device's own font. No face in this folder has the ballot X (✗). Only Charis SIL has the check (✓). The middle dot (·), the multiplication sign (×) and the approximation sign (≈) are in every face here.",
